ch","merged_at":"2026-10-02T14:42:15Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nLight2D and Light3D do not have an icon in master. This PR fixes it by adding icons.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe icon is a mix between the DirectionalLight and OmniLight icons, a bulb with some glow. These are conceptually easy to combine into an icon, and they represent the most common two light types:\r\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"240\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 6 16 02 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83d1aa68-4617-4bb5-909b-921cf82316f5\" />\r\n\r\nDirectionalLight and OmniLight are also currently the only two light types in 2D:\r\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 6 16 31 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fdf8f6e-ef44-4cd0-b8fc-14d9afddb8db\" />\r\n\r\nI experimented with no hollow middle, but it kinda looked too much like the DirectionalLight icon:\r\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"240\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 5 57 44 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acf65f4d-a644-4265-9394-421b19bcc4c5\" />\r\n\r\nTo disambiguate from DirectionalLight, I experimented with a thicker bottom , but it kinda made the icon look too dense and too busy:\r\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"240\" alt=\"thicker_bottom\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9ec4c19-5c6a-4a99-9a8f-b06b1d96641c\" />\r\n\r\nTo disambiguate from DirectionalLight, I also experimented with even thinner \"rays\", but it kinda just looks like an outline:\r\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"240\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 6 01 56 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3b6b7bb-c16d-4936-b218-dd27c3db6b98\" />\r\n\r\nNo AI was used at all. I used [GodSVG](https://godsvg.com/).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122263/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122263/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}